What:		/sys/module/kshrink_slabd/parameters/enabled
Date:		October 2026
Description:	Runtime boolean switch for CONFIG_KSHRINK_SLABD, when built
		in. Disabling prevents new asynchronous requests; one pending
		or running request may finish. Direct reclaim, drop_caches,
		severe pressure and a busy worker remain synchronous. The
		option is off in the default configuration.
